\section*{Ex 2.42 } 
Verify that  
$$
AB = \frac{1}{2}([A,B] + \{A,B\}).
$$  
Consider the RHS:  
$$
\frac{1}{2}([A,B] + \{A,B\}) = \frac{1}{2}((AB - BA) + (AB + BA)) = \frac{1}{2}(AB - BA + AB + BA) = \frac{1}{2}(2AB) = AB.
$$

