\section*{Ex 2.45 } 
Show that  
$$
[A,B]^\dagger = [B^\dagger, A^\dagger].
$$
Proof:  
$$
[A,B]^\dagger = (AB - BA)^\dagger = (AB)^\dagger - (BA)^\dagger = B^\dagger A^\dagger - A^\dagger B^\dagger = [B^\dagger, A^\dagger].
$$

